---
description: How Cursor should generate code
globs: "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

## Mandatory Generation Flow
1. Analyze mockups for shared UI
2. Check /components/ui before creating anything new
3. Build feature blocks
4. Wire to services
5. Apply theme, i18n, logging, validation, security
6. Self-check for violations

## Forbidden
- Duplicate UI atoms
- Hardcoded strings
- Hardcoded colors
- Inline fetch calls
